    <string name="onboard_newbie_title">Welcome!</string>
    <string name="onboard_newbie_content">This Settings page controls the game\'s core options: display, audio, player profiles, song paths, and more. Some options have a small "?" next to their label — tap or focus it to see what that option does or learn more. After starting the game, you can use the floating menu to quickly adjust common options (such as key configuration, FPS display, etc.).</string>
